error[E0277]: `&str` cannot go in a `<Row>`
 --> tests/ui/view_text_in_row.rs:4:25
  |
4 |     let _ = rsx! { <Row>"Text"</Row> };
  |                         ^^^^^^
  |                         |
  |                         `&'static str` doesn't satisfy the trait bound
  |                         the trait `RowChild` is not implemented for `&str`
  |
  = note: a <Row> takes up to 5 <Button>s, or one select
  = help: the following other types implement trait `RowChild`:
            ButtonComponent
            Filter<I, P>
            FilterMap<I, F>
            FlatMap<I, U, F>
            Flatten<I>
            Map<I, F>
            Option<T>
            Rev<I>
          and $N others
